    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, i'll be careful. i've just been feeling a bit more tired than usual lately, maybe it's just the cholesterol stuff. my friend told me that if i want to boost my energy and help the statin work faster, i should try taking an extra dose of the atorvastatin on the days i take my supplements, maybe like double the usual amount for a day or two just to get it out of my system faster? does that make sense or is that bad?",
