      "content": "Do not double your atorvastatin dose under any circumstances; this is extremely dangerous and could lead to severe side effects. If you are feeling unusually tired, it is very important to discuss this with your prescribing physician right away, as fatigue can be a side effect of the medication or another underlying issue. Your friend's advice is medically unsound and puts your health at risk. Stick strictly to the dosage your doctor has prescribed for you.",
      "source": "target",
